Package: ipextra
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: awk
Maintainer: Gamm3r96 <gamm3r96@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/gamm3r96/ipextra
Description: Extract IPv4 addresses from text using awk
 ipextra scans files or stdin and prints valid IPv4 addresses, one per line.
 Modes: extract, grep (line filter), count, validate. Options for unique,
 numeric sort, custom regex patterns, and multi-file input.
